@startuml flowfield-surface
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10
skinparam BoxPadding 6
hide footbox
title Surface2D - request, composition and publication

participant "Manager" as M
participant "Session" as S
participant "Surface / base\nservices" as B
participant "Solve backend\n(worker Burst job)" as G
participant "ModifierRegistry\n/ ModifierPipeline" as F
participant "FieldStore" as P

M -> S : Submit latest request
note over M,S : Submit records input; it does not enter a nested build.
M -> S : FixedUpdate: Pump
S -> B : Prepare or reuse immutable Surface
alt RuntimeDynamic
  S -> B : Prepare obstacles, topology and Goal
  S -> F : Update dirty influence areas\nand compose staging as required
  opt Active Goal and navigation changed
    S -> G : Start BFS with captured input
    G --> S : Completion found by the next frame's poll
    S -> F : Recompose with current accepted final inputs
  end
else StaticBaked
  S -> B : Load validated v6 navigation snapshot
  S -> F : Update dirty areas and compose final values
end
note over S,F : Getter / CaptureSnapshot / Modify calls check ownership on return.\nCancelled work cannot publish into a replacement lifetime.
S -> P : Commit complete arrays, Surface and resolved Goal
P --> S : Effective result changed?
S --> M : FieldChanged when publication changes
M -> S : Provider.TrySample(position)
S -> P : Read committed final values
note over S,P : Session also applies current obstacle / escape / topology safety.\nFinal-only changes reuse navigation and skip an unnecessary BFS.
S --> M : Sample or stopped / unavailable result
@enduml
